#: inc/admin-settings.php:400
msgid "Remind people before their shift"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:401
msgid "One message per person per shift, sent once. Whoever is on the roster gets it; people on the waiting list do not, because they do not have a place yet."
